request.request:
Exploration only: do not edit files, invoke tools, contact anyone or act on proposals. Ignore repository agent instructions. The complete common problem is below, including all context and reference paths. Return a shortlist of exactly three proposals, with brief reasons and assumptions against its supplied criteria. Use your higher reasoning effort to consider alternatives and check the constraints before answering; do not report private reasoning or manufacture work to spend the allowance. Experimental work allowance: about USD 0.03 API-equivalent for this single call, a target rather than an enforced cap. No search-generated material is supplied.

COMMON PROBLEM (JSON):
{"request": "Propose three distinct Spanish opening sentences for a story in which a coastal town loses one minute each evening. Make the missing minute felt through a concrete action and an emotional stake.", "context": {"context_summary": "An adult daughter repairs fishing nets with her father. Only she remembers the missing minute. The opening should create tension without explaining the mechanism.", "facts": ["The setting is a coastal town.", "One minute disappears each evening.", "The daughter remembers it; her father does not.", "They repair fishing nets together."], "constraints": [{"id": "length", "text": "Each proposal is one Spanish sentence of at most 24 words."}, {"id": "exposition", "text": "Do not explain the missing minute's cause or introduce new proper names."}, {"id": "agency", "text": "Give the daughter a concrete action; do not end with a question."}], "assumptions": ["The intended reader accepts an unexplained speculative premise."], "unknowns": ["The cause of the missing minute is deliberately unspecified."], "composition_guidance": "Connect the daughter's action to a sensory trace of the missing minute and her relationship with her father.", "criteria": [{"id": "tension", "text": "A concrete action implies an emotional cost without explaining it."}, {"id": "language", "text": "Natural, economical Spanish with a memorable sensory detail."}, {"id": "difference", "text": "The shortlist offers different actions and emotional possibilities, not paraphrases."}]}, "reference_documents": []}
